OL,4,CThomas Markle indicted in US for       
OL,5,Cpossessing child sex abuse images      
OL,6,GThomas Markle, the father of Meghan,   
OL,7,GDuchess of Sussex has been indicted by 
OL,8,Ga federal grand jury in Los Angeles    
OL,9,Gfor possessing child sex abuse images. 
OL,11,FMarkle, who remains in custody in      
OL,12,FFlorida, allegedly possessed materials 
OL,13,Fthat include at least one image        
OL,14,Finvolving a prepubescent minor and a   
OL,15,Fminor under 12 years old, court        
OL,16,Fdocuments filed in California show.    
OL,18,FThe 82-year-old has denied possessing  
OL,19,Fimages of child sex abuse. He is       
OL,20,Fexpected to be arraigned in Los        
OL,21,FAngeles in the coming weeks.           
